<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 02:23:54 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>PBR 承诺，窃贼在下周二之前“不问任何问题”归还 40,000 磅被盗啤酒。这不会阻止加州检察官</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/31/pabst-blue-ribbon-california-40000-pounds-pbr-beer-stolen/</link><description>据警方称，这大约是 34,000 罐啤酒，价值约 70,000 美元。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2196641407-e1788205338598.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 21:04:12 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/31/pabst-blue-ribbon-california-40000-pounds-pbr-beer-stolen/</guid></item><item><title>美国高中毕业生人数预计将减少 13%。大学已经感受到了压力</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/31/college-enrollment-decline-closures-high-school-graduates/</link><description>随着未来学生的数量开始减少，不断上升的成本和大幅的学费折扣正在挤压大学预算。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-626319252-e1788207740222.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 20:35:43 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/31/college-enrollment-decline-closures-high-school-graduates/</guid></item><item><title>年轻的 Kalshi 用户今年在体育和连本带利类型合约上的交易额估计为 $3.9B，暴露了一个允许他们在 21 岁之前下注的漏洞</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/31/kalshi-users-under-21-traded-3-9-billion-sports-prediction-markets-age-loophole-gambling-regulation/</link><description>批评者警告说，预测市场允许 18 岁的青少年进行体育投注，同时绕过国家投注年龄限制。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2270935165-e1788210240454.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 21:26:54 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/31/kalshi-users-under-21-traded-3-9-billion-sports-prediction-markets-age-loophole-gambling-regulation/</guid></item><item><title>这位 X 一代在小隔间里度过了 28 年，收入从未超过 7 万美元。 59 岁时，她在创作者经济中赚了 50 万美元</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/31/gen-x-creator-economy-ugc-tiktok-shop/</link><description>一些创作者发现，当品牌试图吸引老年消费者时，他们的年龄可能成为一个优势。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2264809814.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 06:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/31/gen-x-creator-economy-ugc-tiktok-shop/</guid></item><item><title>全球最大工作空间提供商的首席执行官表示，到 2040 年，通勤将会消失，而您的孩子会认为这是专业人士曾经做过的“疯狂的事情”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/08/ceo-workspace-iwg-mark-dixon-commuting-extinct-2040-gen-alpha-work-from-anywhere-return-to-office-over/</link><description>IWG 首席执行官马克·迪克森 (Mark Dixon) 表示，未来几代人会认为，老板们曾经让员工“跑 100 英里才能坐下来使用电脑”，这是“疯狂的事情”。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-897448230-e1786114990679.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 08:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/08/ceo-workspace-iwg-mark-dixon-commuting-extinct-2040-gen-alpha-work-from-anywhere-return-to-office-over/</guid></item><item><title>纽约市又发送了 11,000 封临时住所纳税信函，向因未检查 2025 年纳税申报表而被错误瞄准的 1,200 人致歉</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/28/new-york-city-more-pied-a-terre-tax-letters-2025-returns/</link><description>纽约市市长 Zohran Mamdani 在发出 17,000 封警告信之前承认该市缺乏 2025 年税务数据。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2290193702-e1787935294649.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 18:14:52 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/28/new-york-city-more-pied-a-terre-tax-letters-2025-returns/</guid></item><item><title>弗洛克正在创纪录的时间内从监视辩论的中心变成两党共同的目标</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/28/flock-camera-surveillance-bipartisan-sanders-arizona-hawley/</link><description>由于参议员桑德斯和霍利瞄准了华盛顿，亚利桑那州的两个城市与车牌读取器摄像头公司断绝了联系。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2291174724-e1787862318580.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 28 Aug 2026 16:16:19 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/28/flock-camera-surveillance-bipartisan-sanders-arizona-hawley/</guid></item><item><title>理查德·布兰森 (Richard Branson) 双重预订了自己的工作面试。与他一起堵车2.5小时的候选人现在是维珍航空的首席执行官</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/29/virgin-group-ceo-josh-bayliss-double-booked-first-job-interview-by-billionaire-richard-branson-career-lessons-success/</link><description>乔什·贝利斯 (Josh Bayliss) 于 2005 年以律师身份加入维珍，并从理查德·布兰森 (Richard Branson) 非常规的经营方式中汲取经验，升任首席执行官。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/JoshBayliss.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 29 Aug 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/29/virgin-group-ceo-josh-bayliss-double-booked-first-job-interview-by-billionaire-richard-branson-career-lessons-success/</guid></item><item><title>奥利维亚·罗德里戈 (Olivia Rodrigo) 和慈善家梅琳达·弗伦奇·盖茨 (Melinda French Gates) 举办慈善演出，回顾 90 年代女权主义运动，为女性福祉筹集 2000 万美元</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/30/olivia-rodrigo-philanthropy-melinda-french-gates-womens-well-being-dasiy-chain-fields/</link><description>梅琳达·法兰西·盖茨 (Melinda French Gates) 在罗德里戈演出开始时出人意料地亮相，并承诺通过她的 Pivotal Ventures 提供 1000 万美元，并称赞她“向新一代展示了他们的声音有多么重要”。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2292659601-e1788100577933.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 30 Aug 2026 14:48:20 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/30/olivia-rodrigo-philanthropy-melinda-french-gates-womens-well-being-dasiy-chain-fields/</guid></item><item><title>比特币又回来了，迈克尔·塞勒的策略也回来了，该策略在两个月内首次买入</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/31/bitcoin-michael-saylors-strategy-first-buy-two-months/</link><description>在经历了夏季低迷时期筹集现金和出售比特币之后，该公司重新开始买入。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-1321733357-e1788201013787.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 31 Aug 2026 18:34:58 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/31/bitcoin-michael-saylors-strategy-first-buy-two-months/</guid></item></channel></rss>